  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sarphati Sanitation Challenge and Symposium</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2021, Aqua for All, World Waternet and Accenture launched the first Sarphati Sanitation Challenge. The Challenge is a transformation of the Sarphati Sanitation Awards, which have sought to honour entrepreneurial contributions to the global sanitation challenge since 2013. The theme for this edition was &#x201c;Sanitation and Health&#x201d;. We called on entrepreneurs with a viable, scalable and locally-embedded sanitation solution to apply, in order to accelerate access to safe sanitation for all. The winner received a catalytic grant of &#x20ac;100,000 to boost their solution and additional support from Accenture in the scaling-up journey.</narrative>
  </description>
